@echo off\r\nREM ==============================================================================\r\nREM  \U0001f6e0\ufe0f DUCKBOT UTILITIES LAUNCHER v4.2\r\nREM  Unified Utilities Manager for Common Tasks\r\nREM ==============================================================================\r\n\r\nchcp 65001 >nul\r\nset PYTHONUTF8=1\r\nset PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8\r\ntitle DuckBot Utilities Manager\r\ncolor 0A\r\ncls\r\n\r\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f6e0\ufe0f  DUCKBOT UTILITIES MANAGER v4.2\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 MANAGE DUCKBOT SYSTEM WITH POWERFUL UTILITIES:\r\necho.\r\necho 1. \U0001f4e6 [BACKUP] Create Complete DuckBot Backup\r\necho    \u25b6 Exclude AI models and large files\r\necho    \u25b6 Automatic ZIP compression and optimization  \r\necho    \u25b6 Storage-friendly with selective inclusion\r\necho.\r\necho 2. \U0001f504 [RESTORE] Restore DuckBot from Backup\r\necho    \u25b6 Extract backup archives\r\necho    \u25b6 Preserve configurations and settings\r\necho    \u25b6 Verify restoration integrity\r\necho.\r\necho 3. \u26a1 [QUICK-BACKUP] Fast System Snapshot\r\necho    \u25b6 Rapid backup without exclusions\r\necho    \u25b6 Complete system state capture\r\necho    \u25b6 Lightweight and fast operation\r\necho.\r\necho 4. \U0001f527 [SETUP] AI Provider Configuration Wizard\r\necho    \u25b6 Configure LM Studio or OpenRouter\r\necho    \u25b6 Model selection and API key setup\r\necho    \u25b6 Test connections and verify settings\r\necho.\r\necho 5. \U0001fa7a [DIAGNOSTIC] System Health Check\r\necho    \u25b6 Comprehensive system diagnostics\r\necho    \u25b6 Resource usage and performance metrics\r\necho    \u25b6 Python environment and dependency status\r\necho.\r\necho 6. \U0001f310 [UNICODE] Fix Unicode Encoding Issues\r\necho    \u25b6 Resolve character encoding problems\r\necho    \u25b6 Setup proper UTF-8 console support\r\necho    \u25b6 Fix international character display\r\necho.\r\necho 7. \U0001f4cb [CONFIG] Configuration Management\r\necho    \u25b6 Merge and validate configuration files\r\necho    \u25b6 Migrate settings between versions\r\necho    \u25b6 Backup and restore configurations\r\necho.\r\necho 8. \U0001f9ea [TEST] Run Utility Self-Tests\r\necho    \u25b6 Verify all utilities function correctly\r\necho    \u25b6 Test backup/restore operations\r\necho    \u25b6 Validate system integration\r\necho.\r\necho 9. \U0001f5d1\ufe0f  [CLEANUP] Clean Temporary Files\r\necho    \u25b6 Remove cache, logs, and temp files\r\necho    \u25b6 Free disk space and optimize storage\r\necho    \u25b6 Safe cleanup with preservation options\r\necho.\r\necho 0. \U0001f50d [FIND] Locate Files and Directories\r\necho    \u25b6 Search for specific files or patterns\r\necho    \u25b6 Advanced file discovery and filtering\r\necho    \u25b6 Export search results to file\r\necho.\r\necho B. \U0001f519 [BACK] Return to Main Launcher\r\necho.\r\nset /p choice=\"[UTILITIES] Enter your choice: \"\r\n\r\nREM Backup utilities\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"1\" goto create_backup\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"2\" goto restore_backup\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"3\" goto quick_backup\r\n\r\nREM Setup and configuration\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"4\" goto ai_setup\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"5\" goto system_diagnostic\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"6\" goto unicode_fix\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"7\" goto config_management\r\n\r\nREM Testing and maintenance\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"8\" goto utility_tests\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"9\" goto cleanup_files\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"0\" goto find_files\r\n\r\nREM Navigation\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"B\" goto exit_utilities\r\nif /i \"%choice%\"==\"b\" goto exit_utilities\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \u274c Invalid choice: %choice%\r\necho \U0001f4a1 Please enter a valid option (0-9, B)\r\necho.\r\ntimeout /t 3 >nul\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:create_backup\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f4e6 CREATE COMPLETE DUCKBOT BACKUP\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 CREATING: Complete DuckBot Archive with Smart Exclusions\r\necho.\r\n\r\nREM Check Python\r\npython --version >nul 2>&1\r\nif errorlevel 1 (\r\n    echo \u274c Python not found!\r\n    echo \U0001f4e5 Please install Python 3.8+ from: https://www.python.org/downloads/\r\n    echo.\r\n    pause\r\n    goto main_menu\r\n)\r\n\r\necho [START] Starting backup creation process...\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import create_backup\r\nresult = create_backup()\r\nprint('✅ Backup creation completed!')\r\nprint(f'📁 Output: {result.get(\\\"output_path\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\nprint(f'📈 Files: {result.get(\\\"included_files\\\", 0)} included, {result.get(\\\"excluded_files\\\", 0)} excluded')\r\nprint(f'💾 Size: {result.get(\\\"total_size_bytes\\\", 0) / (1024*1024):.1f} MB compressed')\r\n\"\r\n\r\nif errorlevel 1 (\r\n    echo.\r\n    echo \u274c Backup creation failed\r\n    echo \U0001f4a1 Check duckbot_utilities.log for details\r\n) else (\r\n    echo.\r\n    echo ✅ Backup completed successfully!\r\n)\r\n\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:restore_backup\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f504 RESTORE DUCKBOT FROM BACKUP\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 RESTORING: DuckBot System from Archive\r\necho.\r\n\r\nset /p backup_file=\"Enter backup file path: \"\r\nif \"%backup_file%\"==\"\" (\r\n    echo \u274c No backup file specified\r\n    pause\r\n    goto main_menu\r\n)\r\n\r\nif not exist \"%backup_file%\" (\r\n    echo \u274c Backup file not found: %backup_file%\r\n    pause\r\n    goto main_menu\r\n)\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho [RESTORE] Extracting backup archive...\r\npowershell -Command \"Expand-Archive -Path '%backup_file%' -DestinationPath . -Force\"\r\nif errorlevel 1 (\r\n    echo \u274c Restore failed\r\n    echo \U0001f4a1 Try extracting manually with your archive tool\r\n) else (\r\n    echo ✅ Restore completed successfully!\r\n)\r\n\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:quick_backup\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \u26a1 QUICK SYSTEM SNAPSHOT\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 CREATING: Fast System State Capture\r\necho.\r\n\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import create_simple_backup\r\nimport time\r\nbackup_name = f'DuckBot-Quick-Snapshot-{time.strftime(\\\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\\\")}.zip'\r\nresult = create_simple_backup(backup_name=backup_name)\r\nprint('✅ Quick backup completed!')\r\nprint(f'📁 Output: {result.get(\\\"output_path\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\nprint(f'💾 Size: {result.get(\\\"size_bytes\\\", 0) / (1024*1024):.1f} MB')\r\n\"\r\n\r\nif errorlevel 1 (\r\n    echo.\r\n    echo \u274c Quick backup failed\r\n) else (\r\n    echo.\r\n    echo ✅ Quick backup completed successfully!\r\n)\r\n\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:ai_setup\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f527 AI PROVIDER SETUP WIZARD\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 CONFIGURING: AI Provider Integration\r\necho.\r\n\r\necho Select AI Provider:\r\necho 1. LM Studio (Local AI Models)\r\necho 2. OpenRouter (Cloud AI Models)\r\necho.\r\nset /p ai_choice=\"Enter choice (1-2): \"\r\n\r\nif /i \"%ai_choice%\"==\"1\" (\r\n    set \"provider=lm_studio\"\r\n    echo.\r\n    echo \U0001f916 LM Studio Setup:\r\n    echo    \u25b6 Local AI processing with full privacy\r\n    echo    \u25b6 No external API dependencies\r\n    echo    \u25b6 Complete offline operation\r\n    echo.\r\n) else if /i \"%ai_choice%\"==\"2\" (\r\n    set \"provider=openrouter\"\r\n    echo.\r\n    echo \u2601 OpenRouter Setup:\r\n    echo    \u25b6 Cloud AI processing with provider diversity\r\n    echo    \u25b6 Access to 100+ AI models\r\n    echo    \u25b6 Free tier optimized with rate limiting\r\n    echo.\r\n) else (\r\n    echo \u274c Invalid provider choice\r\n    pause\r\n    goto main_menu\r\n)\r\n\r\necho [CONFIG] Configuring %provider%...\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import setup_ai_provider\r\nresult = setup_ai_provider('%provider%')\r\nif result.get('success'):\r\n    print('✅ AI provider configured successfully!')\r\n    config = result.get('config', {})\r\n    print(f'🤖 Provider: {config.get(\\\"provider\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\n    print(f'🧠 Model: {config.get(\\\"model_name\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\nelse:\r\n    print(f'❌ Setup failed: {result.get(\\\"error\\\", \\\"Unknown error\\\")}')\r\n\"\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f4a1 NEXT STEPS:\r\necho    1. For LM Studio: Start LM Studio and load a model\r\necho    2. For OpenRouter: Get API key from https://openrouter.ai/\r\necho    3. Test integration with DuckBot system\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:system_diagnostic\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001fa7a SYSTEM HEALTH DIAGNOSTIC\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 RUNNING: Comprehensive System Analysis\r\necho.\r\n\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import get_system_status, get_python_info\r\nprint('🔍 SYSTEM STATUS:')\r\nstatus = get_system_status()\r\nif 'error' not in status:\r\n    cpu = status.get('cpu', {})\r\n    mem = status.get('memory', {})\r\n    disk = status.get('disk', {})\r\n    print(f'  CPU: {cpu.get(\\\"percent\\\", 0):.1f}%% usage ({cpu.get(\\\"count\\\", 0)} cores)')\r\n    print(f'  Memory: {mem.get(\\\"percent\\\", 0):.1f}%% used ({mem.get(\\\"total_gb\\\", 0):.1f}GB total)')\r\n    print(f'  Disk: {disk.get(\\\"percent\\\", 0):.1f}%% used ({disk.get(\\\"total_gb\\\", 0):.1f}GB total)')\r\nelse:\r\n    print(f'  Error: {status.get(\\\"error\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\n\r\nprint()\r\nprint('🐍 PYTHON ENVIRONMENT:')\r\ninfo = get_python_info()\r\nif 'error' not in info:\r\n    print(f'  Version: {info.get(\\\"python_version\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\n    print(f'  Platform: {info.get(\\\"platform\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\n    print(f'  Architecture: {info.get(\\\"architecture\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\nelse:\r\n    print(f'  Error: {info.get(\\\"error\\\", \\\"Unknown\\\")}')\r\n\"\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f4ca DIAGNOSTIC COMPLETE\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:unicode_fix\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f310 UNICODE ENCODING FIX\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 APPLYING: Unicode Support Configuration\r\necho.\r\n\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import setup_unicode\r\nsuccess = setup_unicode()\r\nif success:\r\n    print('✅ Unicode environment configured successfully!')\r\n    print('  \U0001f310 UTF-8 support enabled for console output')\r\n    print('  \U0001f4dd International characters will display correctly')\r\nelse:\r\n    print('❌ Unicode setup failed')\r\n    print('  \U0001f4a1 Try running as administrator')\r\n\"\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f4a1 TIPS:\r\necho    • Restart command prompt after applying Unicode fixes\r\necho    • Use UTF-8 encoding for text files\r\necho    • Check regional settings in Control Panel\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:config_management\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f4cb CONFIGURATION MANAGEMENT\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 MANAGING: DuckBot Configuration Files\r\necho.\r\n\r\necho Configuration Management Options:\r\necho 1. Merge Configuration Files\r\necho 2. Validate Configuration\r\necho 3. Backup Current Configuration\r\necho 4. Restore Configuration from Backup\r\necho.\r\nset /p config_choice=\"Enter choice (1-4): \"\r\n\r\nif /i \"%config_choice%\"==\"1\" (\r\n    echo.\r\n    set /p base_config=\"Enter base config file: \"\r\n    set /p override_config=\"Enter override config file: \"\r\n    if \"%base_config%\" NEQ \"\" if \"%override_config%\" NEQ \"\" (\r\n        python -c \"\r\nimport json\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import load_config, save_config\r\nbase = load_config('%base_config%')\r\noverride = load_config('%override_config%')\r\nif base and override:\r\n    from duckbot.core.utilities import utilities\r\n    merged = utilities.merge_configs(base, override)\r\n    output_file = 'merged_config.json'\r\n    if save_config(merged, output_file):\r\n        print(f'✅ Configs merged successfully!')\r\n        print(f'📁 Output: {output_file}')\r\n    else:\r\n        print('❌ Failed to save merged config')\r\nelse:\r\n    print('❌ Failed to load configs')\r\n\"\r\n    )\r\n) else (\r\n    echo \u2139\ufe0f  This functionality requires advanced setup\r\n    echo \U0001f4a1 Use the Python utility module directly for advanced config management\r\n)\r\n\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:utility_tests\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f9ea UTILITY SELF-TESTS\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 RUNNING: Comprehensive Utility Verification\r\necho.\r\n\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import utilities\r\nprint('🔬 Testing backup functionality...')\r\ntry:\r\n    result = utilities.create_simple_backup(backup_name='test_backup.zip')\r\n    if result.get('success'):\r\n        print('✅ Backup test: PASS')\r\n    else:\r\n        print('❌ Backup test: FAIL')\r\nexcept Exception as e:\r\n    print(f'❌ Backup test: ERROR - {e}')\r\n\r\nprint()\r\nprint('🔬 Testing Unicode handling...')\r\ntry:\r\n    result = utilities.setup_unicode_environment()\r\n    print(f'✅ Unicode test: {'PASS' if result else 'FAIL'}')\r\nexcept Exception as e:\r\n    print(f'❌ Unicode test: ERROR - {e}')\r\n\r\nprint()\r\nprint('🔬 Testing AI provider setup...')\r\ntry:\r\n    result = utilities.setup_ai_provider('lm_studio')\r\n    if result.get('success'):\r\n        print('✅ AI setup test: PASS')\r\n    else:\r\n        print('❌ AI setup test: FAIL')\r\nexcept Exception as e:\r\n    print(f'❌ AI setup test: ERROR - {e}')\r\n\r\nprint()\r\nprint('✅ Utility self-tests completed!')\r\n\"\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f4ca TEST RESULTS DISPLAYED ABOVE\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:cleanup_files\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f5d1\ufe0f  TEMPORARY FILE CLEANUP\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 CLEANING: System Temporary Files and Caches\r\necho.\r\n\r\necho Cleanup Options:\r\necho 1. Remove Python cache files (__pycache__, *.pyc)\r\necho 2. Clear log files (*.log)\r\necho 3. Delete temporary files (*.tmp, *.temp)\r\necho 4. Clean all temporary and cache files\r\necho.\r\nset /p cleanup_choice=\"Enter choice (1-4): \"\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \u26a0\ufe0f  WARNING: This will remove temporary files!\r\necho    Files will be permanently deleted.\r\necho.\r\nset /p confirm=\"Continue with cleanup? (y/N): \"\r\n\r\nif /i not \"%confirm%\"==\"y\" (\r\n    echo Cleanup cancelled\r\n    pause\r\n    goto main_menu\r\n)\r\n\r\nif /i \"%cleanup_choice%\"==\"1\" goto cleanup_pycache\r\nif /i \"%cleanup_choice%\"==\"2\" goto cleanup_logs\r\nif /i \"%cleanup_choice%\"==\"3\" goto cleanup_temp\r\nif /i \"%cleanup_choice%\"==\"4\" goto cleanup_all\r\n\r\necho \u274c Invalid choice\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:cleanup_pycache\r\necho \U0001f9f9 Removing Python cache files...\r\nfor /d /r %%i in (__pycache__) do (\r\n    if exist \"%%i\" (\r\n        echo   Removing: %%i\r\n        rd /s /q \"%%i\" >nul 2>&1\r\n    )\r\n)\r\nfor /r %%i in (*.pyc) do (\r\n    if exist \"%%i\" (\r\n        echo   Removing: %%i\r\n        del \"%%i\" >nul 2>&1\r\n    )\r\n)\r\necho ✅ Python cache cleanup completed\r\ngoto cleanup_complete\r\n\r\n:cleanup_logs\r\necho \U0001f9f9 Clearing log files...\r\nfor /r %%i in (*.log) do (\r\n    if exist \"%%i\" (\r\n        echo   Clearing: %%i\r\n        echo. > \"%%i\"\r\n    )\r\n)\r\necho ✅ Log file cleanup completed\r\ngoto cleanup_complete\r\n\r\n:cleanup_temp\r\necho \U0001f9f9 Deleting temporary files...\r\nfor /r %%i in (*.tmp *.temp) do (\r\n    if exist \"%%i\" (\r\n        echo   Deleting: %%i\r\n        del \"%%i\" >nul 2>&1\r\n    )\r\n)\r\necho ✅ Temporary file cleanup completed\r\ngoto cleanup_complete\r\n\r\n:cleanup_all\r\necho \U0001f9f9 Cleaning all temporary and cache files...\r\nfor /d /r %%i in (__pycache__) do (\r\n    if exist \"%%i\" (\r\n        echo   Removing cache: %%i\r\n        rd /s /q \"%%i\" >nul 2>&1\r\n    )\r\n)\r\nfor /r %%i in (*.pyc *.pyo *.log *.tmp *.temp) do (\r\n    if exist \"%%i\" (\r\n        echo   Cleaning: %%i\r\n        if \"%%~xi\"==\".log\" (echo. > \"%%i\") else (del \"%%i\" >nul 2>&1)\r\n    )\r\n)\r\necho ✅ Complete cleanup completed\r\ngoto cleanup_complete\r\n\r\n:cleanup_complete\r\necho.\r\necho ✅ Cleanup process finished\r\necho \U0001f4a1 Disk space has been freed\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:find_files\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f50d FILE LOCATOR\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 SEARCHING: Files and Directories\r\necho.\r\n\r\nset /p search_pattern=\"Enter file pattern to search for: \"\r\nif \"%search_pattern%\"==\"\" (\r\n    echo \u274c No search pattern specified\r\n    pause\r\n    goto main_menu\r\n)\r\n\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f50d Searching for: %search_pattern%\r\necho.\r\n\r\npython -c \"\r\nfrom duckbot.core.utilities import utilities\r\nimport os\r\nfiles = utilities.find_files_by_pattern('.', '%search_pattern%')\r\nprint(f'🔍 Found {len(files)} matching files:')\r\nfor i, file in enumerate(files[:20], 1):  # Show first 20 matches\r\n    print(f'  {i:2d}. {file}')\r\nif len(files) > 20:\r\n    print(f'  ... and {len(files) - 20} more files')\r\n\"\r\n\r\necho.\r\npause\r\ngoto main_menu\r\n\r\n:exit_utilities\r\ncls\r\necho.\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho  \U0001f6e0\ufe0f  EXITING DUCKBOT UTILITIES MANAGER\r\necho ================================================================================\r\necho.\r\necho \U0001f680 Returning to main DuckBot launcher...\r\necho.\r\ntimeout /t 2 >nul\r\nexit /b 0